  <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem">OK. We don't touch your USB.</h2>

  <p>Smart if that drive holds your whole library. Then we need <strong>any other USB drive</strong> to carry tonight's tracks.</p>

  <ul class="checklist">
    <li>Ask the other DJs, the promoter, the bar staff — someone has a pen drive.</li>
    <li>Even a small one works. You only need tonight's set, not your library.</li>
  </ul>

